WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.800
Open Collection info and tap Edit.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:14.600
Turn the pages with the arrows:
there are hundreds of icons and emojis.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.444
Pick the one you like and tap Save.
You can also use your own image.

00:00:19.444 --> 00:00:24.044
The collection now shows its new icon.

